%N A399558 Number of strongly connected labeled loopless digraphs on n vertices having period greater than 1.
%C A399558 The period of a strongly connected digraph is the greatest common divisor of the lengths of all its directed cycles.
%F A399558 a(n) = A186081(n) - A070322(n).
%F A399558 a(n) = Sum_{k=2..n} T(n,k), where T(n,k) is the triangle A367948.
%e A399558 a(3) = 5: among the 18 strongly connected labeled loopless digraphs on 3 vertices, 5 have period greater than 1.
